### Get account
GET http://localhost:5000/api/account

### Calculate lot size for $285 @ 10% risk, 20-pt SL
POST http://localhost:5000/api/account/lot-size
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stopLossPoints": 20 }

### Create an open trade
POST http://localhost:5000/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "Buy",
  "entry": 4430,
  "stopLoss": 4380,
  "takeProfit": 4500,
  "notes": "EMA20>EMA50 setup"
}

### Close that trade via a new POST (or PATCH — Phase 2)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/trades

### Tax estimate on $10,000 annual profit
POST http://localhost:5000/api/account/tax-estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "annualProfit": 10000 }

### Projection: $500/mo P/L, 30% withdrawal
POST http://localhost:5000/api/account/projection
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyPnL": 500 }